OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of thousands of workers
OL,4,Aon strike across Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 300,000 workers, including
OL,7,Fnurses, doctors, teachers and civil
OL,8,Fservants, are on strike across the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,11,FIt comes amid an ongoing pay dispute
OL,12,Fbetween public sector workers and the
OL,13,FIrish government, with a further strike
OL,14,Fplanned on 21 October.
OL,16,FIt is expected schools could be closed
OL,17,Fwith hospital appointments cancelled
OL,18,Fand picket lines formed across the
OL,19,Fcountry during the 24-hour strike.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
